## DISCOVERY METHOD (PHASE 2: Authenticated Copilot CLI agent task, 2026-06-14)

Setup:
- Docker image: copilot-discovery:tooled (Ubuntu 22.04 + Node 22 + @github/copilot CLI)
- gh OAuth token obtained via device-flow (gh auth login --web) and captured at /tmp/gh_token
- Discovery gateway: splice-all mode (docker-compose.discovery.yml overlay); Squid peeks SNI
  and splices ALL connections; nothing blocked. Every CONNECT tunnel logged to access.log.
- Container mode: tooled image sharing gateway netns (--network container:copilot-gateway)
- Task executed: copilot CLI agent task reading a buggy JS file (m.js: function add(a,b){return a-b})
  and identifying the bug, using --allow-all-tools --add-dir /tmp

Authentication flow:
- GH_TOKEN and GITHUB_TOKEN env vars set from /tmp/gh_token
- Copilot CLI authenticated against api.individual.githubcopilot.com
- Full agent session: read file, reason about code, return answer

