## KEY FINDINGS (Phase 2, 2026-06-14)

1. TELEMETRY HOST: The real Individual plan telemetry host is
   telemetry.individual.githubcopilot.com, NOT copilot-telemetry.githubusercontent.com.
   The old copilot-telemetry.githubusercontent.com host was never observed.
   Action: Remove copilot-telemetry.githubusercontent.com; the .individual.githubcopilot.com
   wildcard already covers the real telemetry host.

2. ASSET HOST: The real GitHub asset download host is release-assets.githubusercontent.com,
   NOT objects.githubusercontent.com. The Phase 1 probe found objects.githubusercontent.com
   blocked (correctly, it was not on the allowlist), but the authenticated Phase 2 run
   shows the CLI uses release-assets.githubusercontent.com for asset downloads.
   Action: Add release-assets.githubusercontent.com (done). Remove objects.githubusercontent.com
   from any consideration (it was never observed in either session).

3. COPILOT API (INDIVIDUAL PLAN): The Copilot agent API is api.individual.githubcopilot.com.
   This is the Individual plan subdomain. Team and Enterprise plans use different subdomains.
   The allowlist is narrowed from .githubcopilot.com to .individual.githubcopilot.com to
   reduce attack surface for Individual plan users.

4. COLLECTOR.GITHUB.COM: Never observed in any session (Phase 1 or Phase 2). Removed
   from the allowlist as REMOVED-unobserved. It was a carried-pending seed from ADR-002 D4
   that was never confirmed empirically.

5. CAFE.GITHUB.COM: Observed in Phase 2, but ONLY from the gh CLI tool itself, NOT from
   the Copilot agent task. This is a gh CLI internal host used for authentication flows.
   It is NOT needed for the Copilot agent production workflow. Excluded from allowlist.

6. APT BUILD-TIME NOISE: archive.ubuntu.com and security.ubuntu.com were observed during
   container build steps. These are build-time only, not production. Not included in the
   production allowlist.

## ALLOWLIST CHANGES APPLIED (2026-06-14 lock)

NARROWED: .githubcopilot.com -> .individual.githubcopilot.com
  Rationale: Individual plan only uses api.individual + telemetry.individual subdomains.
  Narrows attack surface. Widening back to .githubcopilot.com is the rollback if validation fails.

ADDED: release-assets.githubusercontent.com (OBSERVED 2026-06-14)
  Rationale: This is the real GitHub asset download host, observed in authenticated session.
  Resolves the prior objects.githubusercontent.com open item.

REMOVED: copilot-telemetry.githubusercontent.com (REMOVED-superseded 2026-06-14)
  Rationale: Superseded by telemetry.individual.githubcopilot.com (covered by .individual wildcard).
  Was not observed in authenticated session. The old host name was incorrect for Individual plan.

REMOVED: collector.github.com (REMOVED-unobserved 2026-06-14)
  Rationale: Never observed in Phase 1 or Phase 2 authenticated sessions. Not in the
  current authoritative GitHub Copilot allowlist reference. Carried-pending seed removed.

