### TOKEN SECURITY NOTE

The gh OAuth token captured at /tmp/gh_token in the copilot-discovery:tooled image
was used only for the discovery session. Per cleanup protocol:
- The tooled image (copilot-discovery:tooled) was removed after validation: docker rmi copilot-discovery:tooled
- The gh OAuth token MUST be revoked by the user at github.com/settings/connections
  (Settings -> Applications -> Authorized OAuth Apps -> GitHub CLI -> Revoke)
  or at github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens if a PAT was used.
  The token will also expire on its own, but explicit revocation is recommended.
